The Varjo C API surface used by this module (function names, struct layouts,
status semantics and units) was informed by the official Varjo SDK for Custom
Engines 4.16.0 and the Varjo developer documentation (developer.varjo.com),
Copyright Varjo Technologies Oy. Because redistribution of Varjo SDK headers
and binaries is restricted by the Varjo SDK license, this repository contains
NEITHER varjo.h/Varjo.h NOR any Varjo DLL: the few API declarations the
module needs are hand-written minimal prototypes in src/varjo_api.hpp, the
vendor runtime (VarjoLib.dll) is located only at run time on machines where
Varjo Base is installed, and no vendor code is linked or packaged.

